; Rescued, not a starter: the Fallow Fields' chapter wizard, freed by paying the Tithe-Reeve's scale its due
; (.ai/chapter-wizards.md 4.2). The sorceress of Colchis, granddaughter of the Sun, held in the reeve's granary and
; counted with the grain. Her passive is Rejuvenation, the one axis no other wizard owns: every heal she takes is a
; fifth more (+20% healing). She opens on Solar Flare, two elements (Light and Fire) - a freed wizard may (R2); the
; form deepens Fire.
